            "text": "Overall this was excellent. \n\nPositives :- bus tour covers the key tourist locations and the automated tour guide is informative and quite funny at times. A cracking way of seeing the sites of London\n\nThe River tour which I only went on as part of the package was brilliant and one of the best things we did in London. Was dubious of the point but the unofficial commentary from staff was fantastic and hilarious, plus he gave information which you don’t expect. Absolutely loved it\n\nNegative:- we went in school holidays and as it was a hop on off service they should provide more buses. So beware of going at this time you might not get on the bus and if you do you might not get on top deck. Eventually you will but you may have to do part of the trip on lower decks",
