            "text": "Having availed of and loved this Dinner cruise on 2 previous occasions we were looking forward to this cruise as the highlight of our recent anniversary visit to Paris. Unfortunately the experience was most disappointing. This expected 5 star service had reduced to a 1 star experience. The service, the food and the wine was terrible. There was no entertainment as was offered as part of the package. There was no commentary as part of the sightseeing. Had we been on land we would have stood up and left. I had previously recommended this trip to numerous friends however never again. Overall terribly disappointed. Note also-watch out for Parana taxi drivers waiting on your return seeking excessive Tarif fares. Walk up to the road for 75 % less fee",
